      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Authentication**\n\nI've decided to use Firebase Authentication for user registration in the `register_user.py` file. The Firebase Admin SDK for Python seems like the best tool for this.\n\n\n**Implementing Registration**\n\nI'm now implementing the user registration functionality in `register_user.py` using Firebase. I'm focusing on the Firebase Admin SDK to handle user creation with email and password. I've sketched out the initial file structure, and I'm adding placeholder code for Firebase credentials, which the user will provide.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860483012,
          "start": 1789860480800
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbff8720001WPIobxXCFPIoU5",
